### 2. Rewrite FrameProcessor.kt Without OpenCV

#### [MODIFY] [FrameProcessor.kt](file:///d:/Traffic%20Safety%20Mobile%20App/android/app/src/main/kotlin/com/trafficsafety/traffic_safety_app/FrameProcessor.kt)

**Changes:**
- Remove all OpenCV imports and usage
- Replace YUV-to-RGB conversion with pure Android `Bitmap`/`ImageFormat` operations
- Replace blur detection with variance of Laplacian using Android `RenderScript` or simpler pixel analysis
- Replace resize with `Bitmap.createScaledBitmap`
- Return `ByteBuffer` for TFLite input (same interface)

---

#### [MODIFY] [MainActivity.kt](file:///d:/Traffic%20Safety%20Mobile%20App/android/app/src/main/kotlin/com/trafficsafety/traffic_safety_app/MainActivity.kt)

**Changes:**
- Remove OpenCV initialization (`OpenCVLoader.initDebug()`)
- Update `FrameProcessor` constructor (no longer needs AssetManager for OpenCV)
- Adjust `preprocessFrame` return type (returns `Pair<ByteBuffer, Bitmap>` instead of `Pair<ByteBuffer, Mat>`)

