### 4. Clean Build & Create v6.apk

- Run `flutter clean` to remove all cached build artifacts
- Delete corrupted Kotlin caches: `android\.gradle`, `android\.kotlin`, `build\` directories
- Run `flutter pub get`
- Run `flutter build apk --release`
- Copy the output APK to `d:\Traffic Safety Mobile App\v6.apk`

